    "ai_context": "My project focuses on building an AI Powered Student Assistance System that helps students with academic guidance, learning support, and task automation. The system uses artificial intelligence techniques such as natural language processing and rule based logic to understand student queries and provide relevant responses. The goal is to reduce confusion among students regarding subjects, projects, and learning paths by offering instant and personalized assistance.\n\nThe system can answer academic questions, suggest resources, and help students organize their learning activities. It can also assist in basic automation tasks such as generating summaries, explanations, and structured content for academic use. This project addresses the problem of lack of timely guidance and personalized support in traditional education systems.\n\nThe implementation uses Python as the core programming language along with AI libraries for text processing and logic handling. The project demonstrates how AI can be effectively used to enhance the academic experience and improve productivity for students. The system is scalable and can be extended further with advanced machine learning models and user interfaces.",
